# Development credentials - EXAMPLE ONLY.
#
# Copy this file to `k8s/base/secrets.env` (git-ignored) and replace every value.
# `install.ps1` / `install.sh` do that automatically with random values on a fresh checkout.
#
# Why the real file is not committed: these values gate the operator console and the
# databases. A committed secret is a secret that has been in every clone, every backup and
# every screenshot, and rotating it later does not undo that. The example carries the same
# *shape* so the manifests still render, with values that only work on a throwaway cluster.
